{"availability":"available","full":"TheCarBun/Asknotes","name":"Asknotes","description":"Langchain based AI RAG chat for question answering from PDF notes","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":5,"forks":4,"created":"2024-04-06T09:41:09Z","updated":"2026-04-05T11:23:04Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://asknotes.streamlit.app/home","topics":["artificial-intelligence","langchain","langchain-python","openai-api","openai-chatgpt","streamlit"],"demo":"https://asknotes.streamlit.app/home","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:33:54.601Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T16:33:54.601Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T16:33:54.601Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T16:33:54.601Z","stars":5,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Asknotes is crafted to revolutionize the way students engage with their study materials. By seamlessly reading PDF notes, Asknotes transforms passive information into active learning, making study sessions more effective and enjoyable.","Asknotes is an innovative AI application built with Langchain that leverages the power of RAG(Retrieval Augmented Generation).","With Asknotes, students can effortlessly extract key insights from their PDF notes and receive personalized study guidance, ensuring they grasp concepts with confidence."],"features":["Upload Study Materials: Students can upload one or multiple PDFs containing study materials.","Interactive Q&A: Ask questions about the uploaded content, and AskNotes will provide relevant answers.","Session-based Chat: Tracks chat history during each session, allowing users to refer back to previous interactions.","Secure and Temporary Storage: Uploaded PDFs are temporarily stored for processing and deleted automatically after use.","Streamlit UI: A user-friendly chat interface for engaging with AskNotes, implemented using streamlitchat."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TheCarBun/Asknotes/blob/ma